This package implements the Java SE 21 types that Spring's APIs expose
(flint.java.lang, flint.java.util and related modules). Original Flint code
is contributed under the package licence below by owner decision
(docs/spring/phase1/decisions.md, flint:java* licence); conformance fixtures use
reference results produced by executing the public Java SE 21 API.
The specification and conformance test inventory are pinned to OpenJDK 21.0.13.

CharSequence, Closeable, Flushable, Math, StrictMath, Byte, Short, Integer, Long, Double,
Float and their shared parsing and formatting core are ported from OpenJDK
21.0.13. Their source files retain the upstream copyright and license notices.

